{"title":"Netmender","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Netmender is a named <a href=\"#/monster/dwarf\">Dwarf</a> seen at level 30.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Quests</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-north-p4-frozen-racks\">The Drying Racks</a> <span class=\"muted\">· level 18</span></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find Netmender</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -121, -760</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"netmender\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><p class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for Netmender yet.</p>\n      <h2>Other named Dwarfs</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/dwarf-envoy\">Dwarf Envoy</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/fisher\">Fisher</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/bodvar\">Bodvar</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/hakon\">Hakon</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/quartermaster\">Quartermaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/snowline-warden\">Snowline Warden</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/tackle-seller\">Tackle Seller</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/boatwright\">Boatwright</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/banker-grimsa\">Banker Grimsa</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/forgemaster-dagna\">Forgemaster Dagna</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/elder-brunna\">Elder Brunna</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/elder-thrain\">Elder Thrain</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ingrid\">Ingrid</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/innkeeper-hilde\">Innkeeper Hilde</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/miner-tobb\">Miner Tobb</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/old-varga\">Old Varga</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/sigrun\">Sigrun</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/smith-korri\">Smith Korri</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/quartermaster-ulf\">Quartermaster Ulf</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/greywood-foreman\">Greywood Foreman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/trader\">Trader</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/surveyor\">Surveyor</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/82f2f368b69ecec68fbb.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Netmender</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/dwarf\">Dwarf</a>